    <briefdescription>
<para>Single-process implementation of <ref refid="classthemis_1_1maintenance_1_1_i_distributed_lock" kindref="compound">IDistributedLock</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Suitable for unit tests and single-node deployments where true distributed coordination is not required. Lock state is stored in an in-process map protected by a std::mutex; TTL expiry is checked on each <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1maintenance_1_1_in_process_distributed_lock_1a4ecb88a3612a2c307ade797518724b7a" kindref="member">tryAcquire</ref></computeroutput> call.</para>
<para>Thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
